# Kheer (rice pudding)

- ¼ cup basmati, soaked 30 min, lightly crushed
- 1 litre full-cream milk
- ½ cup sugar, 4 cardamom pods
- almonds and pistachios, slivered; a few strands of saffron

Bring milk to a boil, add rice, simmer on low for 45–60 minutes, stirring often and scraping the bottom, until thick and creamy. Add sugar and cardamom for the last 10 minutes. Garnish with nuts. Serve cold for Eid.
